          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umutambyi ayasuzume, niba ayo mabara y'amera yo ku mubiri we ari ibitare by'ibigina bizaba ari amabara gusa asheshe ku mubiri, azaba adahumanye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.39",
