            "sid": "LEV 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi umwenda ufashwe n'umuze w'ibibembe, naho waba uboheshejwe ubwoya bw'intama cyangwa waba igitare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi naho uwo muze wawufashe mu budodo bw'ubwoya bw'intama cyangwa bw'igitare, butambitse cyangwa mu buhagaritse, kandi naho icyo wafashe cyaba uruhu cyangwa ikintu cyose cyaremwe mu ruhu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niba umuze wenze kwirabura nk'icyatsi kibisi cyangwa ari urususirane, naho wabonetse mu mwenda cyangwa mu ruhu, mu budodo butambitse cyangwa mu buhagaritse, cyangwa mu kintu cyose cyaremwe mu ruhu uzaba ari umuze w'ibibembe, icyo kintu cyerekwe umutambyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we asuzume uwo muze, akingirane icyo wafashe, kimare iminsi irindwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku wa karindwi azasuzume uwo muze, niba uzaba ukwiriye mu mwenda, mu budodo butambitse cyangwa mu buhagaritse, cyangwa mu ruhu rukoreshwa umurimo wose, uwo muze uzabe ari ibibembe bikirya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "bikirya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, byagitinzeho.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kizaba gihumanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atwike uwo mwenda cyangwa ubudodo butambitse cyangwa ubuhagaritse, bw'ubwoya bw'intama cyangwa bw'igitare, cyangwa ikintu cyose cyaremwe mu ruhu cyafashwe n'uwo muze kuko uzaba ari ibibembe bikirya, nigitwikwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
